\cf2 <notes> The forced oath detail matters here. Even forced oaths create theological reality. This isn't about Zedekiah's initial consent but about his subsequent contempt. The text acknowledges the coercion but still holds him accountable for the breaking. </notes>\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl280\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf2 The progression of ownership is striking. The oath moves from:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sl280\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0\cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
