\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The riddle form itself fights compartmentalization. By presenting political reality in botanical imagery first, then revealing the theological dimension, Ezekiel prevents his audience from filing this into their pre-existing categories. They can't immediately slot it into "political advice" or "religious teaching" because the form demands they hold multiple frameworks simultaneously.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl280\partightenfactor0
